Hi Lauren,

We are a few weeks into the program now, so I am starting this thread as the =
one place for status and approvals on the Castaneda, Adams and Davis work, wh=
ich should mean you have a single message to answer instead of several separa=
te ones from Laura, Michelle and me. I have attached version 3 of the kickoff=
 memo, which includes the changes you asked for to the order of the work and =
to who leads each part.

On progress, Michelle has finished a first pass at the shareholder and analys=
t baseline from public sources, Laura has a draft interview guide ready for y=
ou that follows the structure we discussed, and I have a rough outline of the=
 narrative that I am holding back until the interviews give us something to t=
est it against. Michelle's work already points to a few gaps in the register =
that are worth discussing, and I would like to go through those with you once=
 the transfer agent's data lets us confirm them.

To keep the interviews on schedule, could you send us (1) the most recent sha=
reholder register or ownership report from your transfer agent, since the pub=
lic filings only show part of the picture, and (2) your approval of the propo=
sed interviewee list Laura sent last week, with any names you would like adde=
d or removed? Once we have both, Laura will start booking the first conversat=
ions.

Sincerely,
Michael


